    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hunters Estate Agent are delighted to bring No. 87 The Watermill to the market, a superb three-bedroom penthouse apartment, built c. 2006 within this modern development in Raheny, a highly sought after North Dublin suburb.\r\n\r\nPresented in fantastic condition throughout with two double bedrooms (1 ensuite), one single bedroom, a family bathroom and 40 square meters of south and west facing balconies.\r\n\r\nBrilliantly located and tucked away in a quiet yet vibrant, modern development off Watermill Road, overlooking St. Anne's Park, there are a host of amenities within close reach including Raheny Village & Dart Station. \r\n\r\nExtending to circa.  84 sq.m / 904 sq.ft. the accommodation offers an excellent balance of living and bedroom space with well-proportioned rooms.  Briefly the layout comprises an entrance hallway leading into a spacious living room, kitchen, and dining area.  The kitchen is well equipped with fitted cabinetry and a range of appliances.  Off the hallway, there are three good sized bedrooms, one ensuite, a family bathroom, and utility / storage presses. \r\n\r\nThe property will appeal to many, including first time buyers, those downsizing and others who wish to live in a vibrant community and be close to a full array of amenities.  It also provides an ideal investment opportunity. \r\n\r\nAs the property has been vacant for over 2 years it could easily be in line for the ‘Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant’\r\n\r\n\r\nMANAGEMENT COMPANY DETAILS\r\nLansdowne Partnership Estate Agents\r\nFees: €2,400.00 p/a\r\n\r\nBER DETAILS\r\nBER Rating: B2\r\nBER Number: 117668384"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE HALLWAY\r\n5.0m x 1.22m + 4.48m x 1.21m\r\nWelcoming hallway with carpeted flooring.  Alarm panel, security intercom, and storage / hot press cupboards.\r\n\r\nSTORAGE\r\n1.8m x 0.71m\r\nCarpeted flooring with ample storage space and built in storage racks.\r\n\r\nHOT PRESS\r\n1.35m x 0.82m\r\nInsulated water cylinder & immersion, built in storage racks.\r\n\r\nLIVING / DINING ROOM\r\n6.2m x 3.18m + 4.46m x 1.57m\r\nSolid wooden flooring with large windows and door opening to balcony. \r\n\r\nKITCHEN\r\n3.0m x 2.59m (max measurement)\r\nFull range of fitted wall and base units with tiled flooring and granite worktops.  A range of appliances including integrated Beko fridge freezer, Zanussi cooker with extractor hood & induction hob, Samsung washing machine, BEKO dishwasher & newly upgraded Daikin gas boiler.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1\r\n3.66m x 2.78m + 1.9m x 1.1m\r\nDouble bedroom with carpeted flooring, ensuite bathroom, built in wardrobes and window leading to balcony area. \r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 \r\n3.65m x 2.56m\r\nDouble bedroom with carpeted flooring, built in wardrobes and window leading to balcony area.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3\r\n3.67m x 1.96m\r\nSingle bedroom with carpeted flooring and window leading to balcony area.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM\r\n2.37m x 1.80m \r\nTiled flooring and partly tiled walls including bath / shower area, bathtub with wall mounted electric shower and glass shower screen, wall mounted heated towel rack, wash hand basin, wall mounted mirror and WC.\r\n\r\nENSUITE\r\n1.80m x 1.57m \r\nTiled flooring and partly tiled walls including shower enclosure, wall mounted electric shower and glass shower enclosure, wall mounted heated towel rack, wash hand basin, wall mounted mirrored medicine cabinet, storage cabinet and WC.\r\n\r\nBALCONY\r\n6.1m x 2.54m + 9.78m x 2.22m + 4.5m x 0.92m\r\nLarge wrap around balcony extending to approx. 40 sq.m / 430 sq.ft with South and West facing aspects."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\t3-bedroom top floor penthouse apartment extending to c. 84 sq.m / 904 sq.ft.\r\n•\tSouth Westerly facing wrap around balcony (approx. 40 sq.m / 430 sq.ft)\r\n•\tPresented in excellent, turn-key condition\r\n•\tTastefully styled and decorated throughout\r\n•\tGas fired central heating\r\n•\tDouble glazing\r\n•\tMultiple transport links close by\r\n•\tSecure underground car parking space"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
